    <string name="health_data_privacy_title">VITALIS Health Data Privacy</string>

    <string name="health_data_privacy_message">VITALIS uses health data such as heart rate, oxygen saturation, steps, calories, and distance to provide personal health monitoring and risk analysis.

This data is used only for the health-monitoring features of VITALIS.

You control which Health Connect permissions are granted. You can revoke access at any time from Android Health Connect settings.

VITALIS does not sell your health data.</string>

